  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aw8IZDr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&label=DISCORD&logo=discord&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fVoidZ%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?color=7bc466&label=Globox&style=for-the-badge&up_message=Wiki&url=https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/VoidZ/\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Globox1997/VoidZ/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Globox1997/VoidZ?color=c4667b&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"142\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p>\n<p>VoidZ 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventurez\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdventureZ</a> 模組的附加模組。它新增了一個全新的維度，你可以在該維度中尋找並擊敗虛空暗影。</p>\n<p>此附加模組旨在確保 AdventureZ 能夠獨立更新，而無需依賴 Fabric 維度 API。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OEWjMG2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"753\" height=\"676\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"fabric-api\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p>\n<p>本模組專為 Fabric 平台開發。</p>\n<p>目前沒有開發 Forge 版本的計畫。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>整合包使用許可：<strong><br></strong></p>\n<p>歡迎自由將其用於任何整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>錯誤回報：</p>\n<p>請直接在 GitHub 頁面回報問題。</p>",
